        "column": 17,
        "endLine": 118,
        "endColumn": 19,
        "help": "Why: the browser builds the DOM by re-parsing the rendered HTML (server-side rendering, static content inserted with innerHTML). Where this template disagrees with the HTML parser, the browser's DOM differs from the virtual DOM: hydration mismatches, and styles and scripts see a different tree.\nFix: move the element to a place its parent accepts, or change the outer element (for example <div> instead of <p>, <tbody> around table rows)."
